      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additionally, it's possible for the VR Chat team to partner up with creators of third party clients, in order to integrate the positive features of these third party programs into the game whilst refusing to implement the destructive and malicious features that these programs can present, this should serve to increase the quality of the game, whilst deterring people with malicious intent.",
