      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Unfortunately, they've decided to create a Marketplace. I find it in poor taste and not very well thought out.\nI agree that adding quality of life things through some sort of subscription based system would be a much smarter plan. While I'm unsure how well Discord is doing with the majority of their income being based around users paying for Nitro to attain all of the vanity perks, something similar would probably be more successful for something like VRC in the long-term.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-02-17T18:40:58.110Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VR Chat can do more to generate revenue to extend the longevity of the game. My suggestion would be a donations style system such as that used in OSU! With a variety of donation benefits, one of which being a public avatar search function that you can use right from your hand menu. Through this, VR Chat can begin to generate real revenue, and hire additional staff in order to secure a successful future for the game. Many of my own friends and I would personally endorse this change and fork out money for these additional quality of life improvements.",
